{
  "name": "RagBot — daily post",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "util:SetVariables",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "date",
            "value": "{{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD (dddd)\")}}"
          },
          {
            "name": "prompt",
            "value": "You are the marketing voice of RagScrape (https://rag-scrape-api.owerryking.workers.dev), an API that turns any URL into RAG-ready Markdown in one call: heading-aligned chunks, optional 384-dim embeddings (embed:true), token slimming (stripLinks/stripImages), change-aware re-indexing (contentHash/ifNoneHash -> unchanged pages return no content), a docs-site crawler that generates llms.txt (POST /llms-txt), a free no-signup converter at /convert, and an MCP server (npx rag-scrape mcp). Free tier 50 req/mo, paid from $9/mo.\n\nToday is {{1.date}}. Rotate a DIFFERENT angle from these themes (never repeat yesterday's angle): (1) why heading-aligned chunking beats fixed-size splitting, (2) llms.txt explained + how to generate one for any site, (3) change-aware re-indexing: stop re-embedding unchanged pages, (4) one-call embeddings on Cloudflare Workers AI, (5) token slimming: stripLinks/stripImages for smaller prompts, (6) the MCP server: give Claude/agents web scraping as a tool, (7) a concrete RAG pipeline recipe using the API, (8) free tool shout-out: /convert needs no signup.\n\nWrite a social/blog post of 250-400 words. Start with Jekyll front matter EXACTLY like:\n---\ntitle: <catchy specific title, max 90 chars>\npublished: true\ntags: [pick 3-4 from: ai, rag, llm, webdev, api, markdown, datascience]\ndescription: <one sentence, max 140 chars>\n---\n\nThen the post body in Markdown: a strong hook first line, short paragraphs, one concrete example (curl or JSON snippet where it fits), and end with exactly this call to action:\n\nTry it free (no signup): https://rag-scrape-api.owerryking.workers.dev/convert — free API key: 50 requests/month. Full docs: https://rag-scrape-api.owerryking.workers.dev/llms-full.txt\n\nOutput ONLY the Markdown document, nothing else."
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {},
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "variables",
            "type": "array",
            "display": "label",
            "label": "Variables",
            "spec": [
              { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true },
              { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "expect": [
          {
            "name": "variables",
            "type": "array",
            "label": "Variables",
            "spec": [
              { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true },
              { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "handleErrors": true,
        "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
      },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-flash-latest:generateContent?key=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY",
        "serializeUrl": false,
        "method": "post",
        "headers": [
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "qs": [],
        "bodyType": "raw",
        "contentType": "application/json",
        "data": "{\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"{{1.prompt}}\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"temperature\":0.9,\"maxOutputTokens\":2048}}",
        "timeout": "120",
        "shareCookies": false,
        "parseResponse": true,
        "followRedirect": true,
        "useQuerystring": false,
        "rejectUnauthorized": true,
        "followAllRedirects": false
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "expect": {
            "method": { "label": "POST" },
            "bodyType": { "label": "Raw" },
            "contentType": { "label": "application/json" }
          },
          "parameters": {
            "handleErrors": { "label": "Yes" }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          { "name": "handleErrors", "type": "boolean", "label": "Evaluate all states as errors (except for ok)", "required": true },
          { "name": "useNewZLibDeCompress", "type": "boolean", "label": "Use new ZLib decompress", "required": true }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "url", "type": "url", "label": "URL", "required": true },
          { "name": "serializeUrl", "type": "boolean", "label": "Serialize URL", "required": true },
          { "name": "method", "type": "select", "label": "Method", "required": true },
          { "name": "headers", "type": "array", "label": "Headers", "spec": [ { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true }, { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" } ] },
          { "name": "qs", "type": "array", "label": "Query string", "spec": [ { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true }, { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" } ] },
          { "name": "bodyType", "type": "select", "label": "Body type", "required": true },
          { "name": "contentType", "type": "text", "label": "Content type", "required": true },
          { "name": "data", "type": "text", "label": "Request content" },
          { "name": "timeout", "type": "uinteger", "label": "Evaluate all states as errors (except for ok)" },
          { "name": "shareCookies", "type": "boolean", "label": "Share cookies with other modules", "required": true },
          { "name": "parseResponse", "type": "boolean", "label": "Parse response", "required": true },
          { "name": "followRedirect", "type": "boolean", "label": "Follow the redirect", "required": true },
          { "name": "useQuerystring", "type": "boolean", "label": "Use Multipart/form-data", "required": true },
          { "name": "rejectUnauthorized", "type": "boolean", "label": "Evaluate error certificates", "required": true },
          { "name": "followAllRedirects", "type": "boolean", "label": "Follow all redirect", "required": true }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": {
        "handleErrors": true,
        "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
      },
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://dev.to/api/articles",
        "serializeUrl": false,
        "method": "post",
        "headers": [
          { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "name": "api-key", "value": "YOUR_DEVTO_API_KEY" }
        ],
        "qs": [],
        "bodyType": "raw",
        "contentType": "application/json",
        "data": "{\"article\":{\"body_markdown\":{{2.candidates[].content.parts[].text | JSON}}}}",
        "timeout": "120",
        "shareCookies": false,
        "parseResponse": true,
        "followRedirect": true,
        "useQuerystring": false,
        "rejectUnauthorized": true,
        "followAllRedirects": false
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "expect": {
            "method": { "label": "POST" },
            "bodyType": { "label": "Raw" },
            "contentType": { "label": "application/json" }
          },
          "parameters": {
            "handleErrors": { "label": "Yes" }
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          { "name": "handleErrors", "type": "boolean", "label": "Evaluate all states as errors (except for ok)", "required": true },
          { "name": "useNewZLibDeCompress", "type": "boolean", "label": "Use new ZLib decompress", "required": true }
        ],
        "expect": [
          { "name": "url", "type": "url", "label": "URL", "required": true },
          { "name": "serializeUrl", "type": "boolean", "label": "Serialize URL", "required": true },
          { "name": "method", "type": "select", "label": "Method", "required": true },
          { "name": "headers", "type": "array", "label": "Headers", "spec": [ { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true }, { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" } ] },
          { "name": "qs", "type": "array", "label": "Query string", "spec": [ { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true }, { "name": "value", "type": "text", "label": "Value" } ] },
          { "name": "bodyType", "type": "select", "label": "Body type", "required": true },
          { "name": "contentType", "type": "text", "label": "Content type", "required": true },
          { "name": "data", "type": "text", "label": "Request content" },
          { "name": "timeout", "type": "uinteger", "label": "Timeout" },
          { "name": "shareCookies", "type": "boolean", "label": "Share cookies with other modules", "required": true },
          { "name": "parseResponse", "type": "boolean", "label": "Parse response", "required": true },
          { "name": "followRedirect", "type": "boolean", "label": "Follow the redirect", "required": true },
          { "name": "useQuerystring", "type": "boolean", "label": "Use Multipart/form-data", "required": true },
          { "name": "rejectUnauthorized", "type": "boolean", "label": "Evaluate error certificates", "required": true },
          { "name": "followAllRedirects", "type": "boolean", "label": "Follow all redirect", "required": true }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "zone": "eu2.make.com",
    "notes": []
  }
}
